=== meta ===
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
title: deleting a README kept under .github/workflows/ removes no pipeline
origin: ruling 197.Q5 (2026-10-03) - only YAML beneath .github/workflows/ is a workflow, the definition the control-flow reader already used. v0.5.0 read this deletion as a removed workflow that ran tests (the README names pytest) and blocked at high; it stays visible at warn
=== before: .github/workflows/README.md ===
Run pytest locally before pushing.
=== expect ===
[{"rule": "CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED", "severity": "warn"}]
